# Kilo Code Rules

- Project Type: Python CLI & Desktop GVI Application.
- Workspace: Always work directly in the current workspace directory and on the active git branch.
- No Git Worktrees: NEVER create, switch to, or duplicate files into Git worktrees or `.kilo/worktrees/`.
- No Webapp Scaffolding: Do NOT create separate "webapp" folders, node_modules, package.json, or web frontend templates.
- Maintain existing Python application architecture.
